**File responsibilities:**
- `FastMath.h` — fast tanh/atan/exp approximations (header-only, no deps)
- `DCBlocker.h` — first-order HPF at 5Hz, SR-scaled (header-only)
- `DelayLine.h` — ring buffer delay with linear interpolation (header-only)
- `TextureBodyDetector` — dual envelope follower + spectral flux for modulation
- `Waveshaper` — soft/hard curves with bypass-at-zero and DC blocker
- `SpectralDroneEngine` — FFT-based spectral freeze/smear/drift, 48kHz mono internal
- `ChorusEnsemble` — 4-voice detuned chorus for stereo thickening
- `ResonantFilter` — Cytomic TPT SVF, Q 0.5–100, auto-gain compensation
- `DriveCircuit` — adaptive pre-gain + warm/grit saturation + tone tilt
- `StereoWidener` — LR2 crossover at 250Hz + M/S processing
- `ModulationEngine` — 3 self-evolving LFOs + audio-reactive envelope + spectral flux input
- `PresetData.h` — factory preset parameter values
- `PresetManager` — preset morphing with gesture exclusion
- `PluginProcessor` — APVTS, full signal flow, processBlock, state save/restore
- `PluginEditor` — 950×580 cosmic GUI with all controls
- `CogLookAndFeel` — cosmic interdimensional visual theme
- `PresetBar` — preset selector + morph controls

