# Cog VST Implementation Plan — Bug-Free Production Build

## Context

The Cog VST is a psychedelic sound design module with parallel texture/body paths, spectral drone engine, self-resonating filters, drive circuit, feedback loop, stereo widener, and modulation system. A previous implementation plan contained 20 bugs identified through audit. This plan creates the project from scratch with all fixes incorporated.

**Critical Issues Fixed:**
1. Delay line reads now correctly walk backwards through buffer per sample
2. Removed double-scaling of texture coefficient (was scaled at split AND in Waveshaper)
3. Latency compensation now correctly accounts for decimation factor at high sample rates
4. SpectralDroneEngine decimCount is now a member variable (persists across blocks)
5. Output gain moved BEFORE limiter (or final clamp added after gain)

**Important Issues Fixed:**
6. SmoothedValue now properly supports per-sample smoothing when active
7. ModulationEngine now has separate attack/release coefficients (10ms/100ms)
8. DriveCircuit RMS tracking now per-channel (not shared between L/R)
9. PresetManager uses atomic<bool> flags instead of std::set for thread safety
10. StereoWidener always processes crossover filters (skips only M/S widening when width=0)
11. SpectralDroneEngine pre-allocates temp buffers as member arrays (no stack allocation in audio thread)

**Moderate Issues Fixed:**
12. Tone filter coefficients computed once per block (not per sample)
13. Removed unused toneCoeff parameter from DriveCircuit::processSample
14. Buffers pre-allocated in prepareToPlay (no setSize in processBlock)
15. Chorus uses constexpr std::array for portability
16. Path balance crossfade uses per-sample SmoothedValue (no click on automation)
17. Removed unused setupKnob declaration from PluginEditor.h

**Spec Deviations Addressed:**
18. Implemented SmoothedValue block-mode optimization (branch on isSmoothing())
19. Added spectral engine conditional bypass (skip when density=0, no freeze, no drift)
20. Spectral drift correctly proportional during freeze crossfade

## Project Directory

`/home/myuser/CogVST/`

## Implementation Tasks

### Task 1: Project Setup & CMake

Create project structure with JUCE 7.0.12:

```
CogVST/
├── CMakeLists.txt
├── src/
│   ├── PluginProcessor.h/cpp
│   ├── PluginEditor.h/cpp
