**Fix #2 (Critical):** No texture coefficient scaling inside process(). Buffer was already scaled at split stage:
```cpp
void process(juce::AudioBuffer<float>& buffer, float textureDrive) {
    // Buffer already scaled by texture coefficient at split stage
    // NO double-scaling here
    for (int i = 0; i < numSamples; ++i) {
        float outL = processSample(left[i], textureDrive); // NOT left[i] * coeffA
        ...
    }
}
