    // ...
}
```

### Task 13: PluginProcessor — processBlock

**Fix #1 (Critical):** Correct delay reads in merge loop:
```cpp
for (int i = 0; i < numSamples; ++i) {
    // Walk backwards through delay buffer
    float aL = waveshaper.readDelayedL(spectralLatencySamples, numSamples - 1 - i);
    float aR = waveshaper.readDelayedR(spectralLatencySamples, numSamples - 1 - i);
    // ...
}
```

**Fix #5 (Critical):** Output gain BEFORE limiter:
```cpp
// Step 10: Output gain (before limiter)
float outputGainLinear = std::pow(10.0f, outputGainDB / 20.0f);
for (int i = 0; i < numSamples; ++i) {
    outL[i] *= outputGainLinear;
    outR[i] *= outputGainLinear;
}

// Step 11: Final limiter (tanh)
for (int i = 0; i < numSamples; ++i) {
    outL[i] = CogDSP::fastTanh(outL[i]);
    outR[i] = CogDSP::fastTanh(outR[i]);
}
```

**Fix #6 (Important):** Per-sample SmoothedValue when active:
```cpp
for (int i = 0; i < numSamples; ++i) {
    float balance = smPathBalance.getNextValue();  // Per-sample when smoothing
    float density = smDroneDensity.getNextValue();
    // ...
}
```

**Fix #14 (Moderate):** No setSize in processBlock — use pre-allocated buffers.

**Fix #18 (Spec):** Block-mode optimization:
```cpp
if (smPathBalance.isSmoothing()) {
    for (int i = 0; i < numSamples; ++i) {
        pathBalance = smPathBalance.getNextValue();  // Per-sample
